---

This mod bundles no third-party components. It is Python source, plus its own data files.

It does not run on its own. It needs NMS.py (NMSpy), which brings pyMHF with it, and Project
Oreo Runtime for the overlay and controller support. Those are separate projects under their
own licences, they are installed separately, and no part of them is included here.
